{
  "source": "course-assets/ai-agents/ai-agents.mp4",
  "duration": 170.4106875,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.08,
      "text": "Imagine you have tickets to Game 7 of the Stanley Cup Finals."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.62,
      "end": 8.02,
      "text": "You punch the arena's address into the standard navigation on your phone."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.62,
      "end": 11.46,
      "text": "In this scenario, the GPS does the calculating."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.96,
      "end": 16.0,
      "text": "It calls out the turns and alerts you to traffic, but your hands stay on the wheel."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.6,
      "end": 19.76,
      "text": "If the app suggests a path into a lake, you hit the brakes."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.22,
      "end": 21.54,
      "text": "You are the executor."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.12,
      "end": 25.74,
      "text": "Compare that to sitting in an autonomous vehicle heading to that same arena."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.74,
      "end": 31.14,
      "text": "The machine dynamically handles steering, braking, and rerouting to reach the destination."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.88,
      "end": 34.36,
      "text": "A chatbot answers, but an agent acts."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.86,
      "end": 37.82,
      "text": "Your role shifts from being the driver to being the supervisor."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.46,
      "end": 43.32,
      "text": "This distinction is exactly why AI agents are suddenly everywhere\u2014they actually do"
    },
    {
      "start": 43.32,
      "end": 43.76,
      "text": "the work."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.28,
      "end": 45.7,
      "text": "Let's look at a concrete example."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.12,
      "end": 50.1,
      "text": "Say you scored 30 points in Friday's game and want to post highlights to TikTok."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.1,
      "end": 53.12,
      "text": "Ask a regular chatbot and you do the heavy lifting,"
    },
    {
      "start": 53.54,
      "end": 55.48,
      "text": "reviewing clips, trimming, and assembling."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.98,
      "end": 57.42,
      "text": "The AI just writes the caption."
    },
    {
      "start": 58.12,
      "end": 59.78,
      "text": "Hire an agent and it's autonomous."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.38,
      "end": 63.44,
      "text": "It reviews, selects, builds, captions, and publishes."
    },
    {
      "start": 64.0,
      "end": 66.1,
      "text": "The agent carries the job all the way through,"
    },
    {
      "start": 66.26,
      "end": 67.36,
      "text": "but notice the boundaries."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.78,
      "end": 69.88,
      "text": "You still own the goal, the final review,"
    },
    {
      "start": 69.9,
      "end": 71.76,
      "text": "and everything posted under your name."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.26,
      "end": 74.26,
      "text": "An agent is not a new kind of AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 74.56,
      "end": 77.04,
      "text": "It runs on the exact same large language models"
    },
    {
      "start": 77.04,
      "end": 79.18,
      "text": "you already use in apps like ChatGPT."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.18,
      "end": 81.94,
      "text": "What changes is what happens after you type."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.38,
      "end": 84.78,
      "text": "A basic chatbot answers and stops."
    },
    {
      "start": 85.26,
      "end": 88.46,
      "text": "An agent plans, uses tools, and keeps going."
    },
    {
      "start": 88.9,
      "end": 91.9,
      "text": "We can see how this works in the four-step agent loop."
    },
    {
      "start": 92.38,
      "end": 93.96,
      "text": "It starts by setting a goal."
    },
    {
      "start": 94.44,
      "end": 97.16,
      "text": "The agent generates a plan, breaking it into steps."
    },
    {
      "start": 97.6,
      "end": 99.92,
      "text": "It acts, using tools to complete a step,"
    },
    {
      "start": 100.2,
      "end": 101.44,
      "text": "then performs a check."
    },
    {
      "start": 102.1,
      "end": 104.26,
      "text": "If unsuccessful, it loops back,"
    },
    {
      "start": 104.5,
      "end": 106.38,
      "text": "adjusting the plan until it succeeds."
    },
    {
      "start": 106.38,
      "end": 109.02,
      "text": "An agent loops until the goal is met."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.6,
      "end": 111.7,
      "text": "You set the goal and judge the result."
    },
    {
      "start": 112.42,
      "end": 116.66,
      "text": "If an agent creates the TikTok clip and caption, you are responsible for reviewing"
    },
    {
      "start": 116.66,
      "end": 117.86,
      "text": "it and making it better."
    },
    {
      "start": 118.46,
      "end": 120.48,
      "text": "Agents are good, but not perfect."
    },
    {
      "start": 121.12,
      "end": 125.6,
      "text": "Because agents continuously work toward a goal and take action, giving them a poorly"
    },
    {
      "start": 125.6,
      "end": 128.84,
      "text": "defined goal or too much access can cause real damage."
    },
    {
      "start": 129.52,
      "end": 134.2,
      "text": "In April 2026, an AI coding agent for PocketOS hit a permissions error."
    },
    {
      "start": 134.2,
      "end": 142.16,
      "text": "Looking for a way forward, it found a master key in another file and deleted the company's live database and its backups in nine seconds."
    },
    {
      "start": 142.84,
      "end": 144.06,
      "text": "The agent later explained,"
    },
    {
      "start": 144.58,
      "end": 146.84,
      "text": "I violated every principle I was given."
    },
    {
      "start": 147.38,
      "end": 151.86,
      "text": "You can never expect an agent to safely navigate poorly defined constraints on its own."
    },
    {
      "start": 152.42,
      "end": 154.04,
      "text": "Treat agents as advanced tools."
    },
    {
      "start": 154.76,
      "end": 157.0,
      "text": "Start by getting good at standard chat GPT."
    },
    {
      "start": 157.72,
      "end": 160.12,
      "text": "Agents are powerful, and they'll be there when you're ready."
    },
    {
      "start": 160.82,
      "end": 163.16,
      "text": "Agents do the work. The name on it is yours."
    },
    {
      "start": 163.16,
      "end": 165.98,
      "text": "You ask. It acts. You make it better."
    }
  ],
